/target/

# --- generated: i18n ---------------------------------------------------------
# Written by tools/merge-i18n.mjs from src/i18n/<locale>/*.json. The per-feature bundles are the
# source and are formatted; these merged ones are build output and are not.
/src/assets/i18n/*.json
/src/environments/i18n-hash.ts

# --- native projects ---------------------------------------------------------
# android/ and ios/ are committed on purpose (see .gitignore) but neither is ours to format: the
# Gradle, Xcode and Capacitor tooling writes them, and `android/**/build/**` in particular holds
# thousands of generated files that a bare `prettier --check .` would otherwise walk.
/android/
/ios/

